  (text "kisi 0.3.3: lane D0 – linear test bench\nEach element symbol calls its subcircuit in D0.lib through a wrapper `<name>_k` in D0_kicad.lib (reference node = ground).\nA part's Value is its subcircuit parameter c, r or l (Sim.Params refers to the Value field; SPICE notation): edit the value, the parasitics stay.\nProbe the receiver die; for a pair the difference of P and N. Inspect → Simulator → Run.\nAdd a termination or swap the ends here; IBIS ends: replace the source/receiver by KiCad IBIS symbols." (at 38.10 38.10 0)
