  (text "Transmitter (single-ended): profile se50, 1.000 Gbit/s, PRBS7, edge 100.0 ps (10-90 %).\nThevenin source: emf ±2.000 V behind R 50.00 Ω, C 1.000 pF at the die.\nA voltage-mode driver with 50.00 Ω source resistance.\nThe emf is scaled so that the receiver sees ±1.000 V at DC.\n\nReceiver (single-ended): R 50.00 Ω and C 1.000 pF from the die to ground.\nProbe the die node (top of CRX/RRX)." (at 38.10 101.60 0)
